  "account": "赵健的读书日记",
  "source_title": "诸君，你相信吗，想改变人的一生就四个字：物归原位，这个好习惯一定要从小培养，当你用完物品放回原处，可以减少你90%的家务，这不是强迫症,这叫归位习惯，是把内耗降到最低的生活智慧。人在疲惫的时候会滋生出冷漠和暴躁，人在贫穷拮据的时候会变得狭隘和自私，人只有在快乐的时候才会产生出包容和乐观，很多时候所谓的性格其实并不是一个人的固定品格，而是他所处状态的外形。#断舍离 #秋收冬藏 #秋天 #治愈",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 223.036,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "朱君，你相信吗？想改变人的一生，就四个字物归原位，这个好习惯一定要从小培养。当你用完物品放回原处，可以减少你百分之九十的家务，这不是强迫症，这叫归位。习惯是把内耗降到最低的生活智慧，你能想象吗？如果一个人突然开始变得不讲卫生，家里乱糟糟的垃圾堆着懒得扔，东西也放的乱七八糟，不想收拾，并且无法自控的习惯性熬夜，那说明这个人很可能已经被心理问题快拖垮了。人在疲惫的时候会滋生出冷漠和暴躁。人在贫穷拮据的时候，就会变得狭隘和自私人，只有在快乐的时候，才会产生出包容和乐观。很多时候所谓的性格，其实并不是一个人的固定品格，而是他所处状态的外形。比如说我最近写稿子写不出来，特别烦躁，而我做的第一件事情就是收拾屋子，打扫卫生，先让我的生活恢复秩序垃圾，该扔的扔掉，闲置的东西，该处理的处理掉。我整个人心理状态会特别清爽舒服，你也可以试一下。当你内在的秩序无法维持的时候，可以尝试建立外在的秩序。通过外部的秩序来回馈到你的内心，让你重拾对生活、对自我的掌控感。你有没有想过，为什么有些人他的家里永远干净整洁，事业顺风顺水，而有些人明明很努力，却总感觉被一种看不见的力量拖着后腿，你知道吗？你家里的那些杂物，甚至冰箱里的过期食品，都在悄悄消耗着你的能量，影响着你人生的走向。如果你想真正掌控生活的秩序感，一定要记住哦。使用频次越高的东西越该选用好的，而每周使用不超过三次的物品，就尽量没必要买回家。越复杂的东西故障风险越高。越精致美观的东西便携性越差。集成度越高的东西，专业性越弱，这就是消费领域最为明智的法则。要明确你的核心需求在关键处，专注在冗余处舍弃。老话说秋后算账，其实人到秋天真的得算。一、算账消耗你的人要断，第一回报的事儿要清。一清攒了好久的塑料袋儿，多年不穿的旧衣服等等，都扔一扔，大胆的先很多人什么东西都攒着，什么都舍不得扔。辣酱瓶子、茶叶、罐子、月饼盒子，各种外卖袋子，什么都存，就是不存钱。但是你相信吗，你越扔东西，你就活得越好一个东西。如果长期不使用，你不和它发生联系，它还会偷偷吸走你的能量。古人说，秋收东藏每一年一到秋天，你可以扔几件没用的东西，扔掉讨厌的人就更好，你会莫名其妙的变得幸运。传统文化中秋对应着金，代表着收敛裁决，所谓秋后算账。秋天的天时，就是让你舍弃不舍，就不得有舍才有得这就是今生水。你一定要相信大钱，喜欢空喜欢安静，越空越有钱。收起那些廉价的囤积欲，清空你的环境。空间越满，焦虑越重，欲望越多，判断越乱。而真正的清醒是清空环境，清空无效社交，清空廉价信息。有一种富有叫干净普通人的家，因为干净而富足，因为干净，所以心情舒畅自然会带来福气。究今夏天已经结束了，一转眼，二零二六年也只剩下三分之一。把时间献给最值得的人和事儿，扔掉那些很久不用，以后也不会再用的东西，扔掉你内心所有的抱怨和杂念，扔掉所有让你不舒服的关系，让自己轻盈轻装上阵。暑去又一秋，愿君多珍重。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00001",
      "start_ms": 400,
      "end_ms": 800,
      "text": "朱君，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1080,
      "end_ms": 1880,
      "text": "你相信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2060,
      "end_ms": 3320,
      "text": "想改变人的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3320,
      "end_ms": 5460,
      "text": "就四个字物归原位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5840,
      "end_ms": 7860,
      "text": "这个好习惯一定要从小培养。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8100,
      "end_ms": 9880,
      "text": "当你用完物品放回原处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00007",
      "start_ms": 9900,
      "end_ms": 11800,
      "text": "可以减少你百分之九十的家务，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11940,
      "end_ms": 13000,
      "text": "这不是强迫症，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13060,
      "end_ms": 13880,
      "text": "这叫归位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00010",
      "start_ms": 13880,
      "end_ms": 17240,
      "text": "习惯是把内耗降到最低的生活智慧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17500,
      "end_ms": 18280,
      "text": "你能想象吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00012",
      "start_ms": 18280,
      "end_ms": 20540,
      "text": "如果一个人突然开始变得不讲卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20720,
      "end_ms": 23400,
      "text": "家里乱糟糟的垃圾堆着懒得扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23520,
      "end_ms": 24900,
      "text": "东西也放的乱七八糟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24900,
      "end_ms": 25620,
      "text": "不想收拾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25900,
      "end_ms": 28260,
      "text": "并且无法自控的习惯性熬夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28480,
      "end_ms": 31930,
      "text": "那说明这个人很可能已经被心理问题快拖垮了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32350,
      "end_ms": 35830,
      "text": "人在疲惫的时候会滋生出冷漠和暴躁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00019",
      "start_ms": 36170,
      "end_ms": 37990,
      "text": "人在贫穷拮据的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00020",
      "start_ms": 38050,
      "end_ms": 40070,
      "text": "就会变得狭隘和自私人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40070,
      "end_ms": 41330,
      "text": "只有在快乐的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00022",
      "start_ms": 41410,
      "end_ms": 43550,
      "text": "才会产生出包容和乐观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00023",
      "start_ms": 43790,
      "end_ms": 45170,
      "text": "很多时候所谓的性格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00024",
      "start_ms": 45270,
      "end_ms": 47250,
      "text": "其实并不是一个人的固定品格，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47410,
      "end_ms": 49230,
      "text": "而是他所处状态的外形。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00026",
      "start_ms": 49490,
      "end_ms": 51230,
      "text": "比如说我最近写稿子写不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00027",
      "start_ms": 51230,
      "end_ms": 51930,
      "text": "特别烦躁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52150,
      "end_ms": 54610,
      "text": "而我做的第一件事情就是收拾屋子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54650,
      "end_ms": 55390,
      "text": "打扫卫生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00030",
      "start_ms": 55590,
      "end_ms": 58050,
      "text": "先让我的生活恢复秩序垃圾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00031",
      "start_ms": 58050,
      "end_ms": 58870,
      "text": "该扔的扔掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00032",
      "start_ms": 59030,
      "end_ms": 59885,
      "text": "闲置的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60110,
      "end_ms": 61150,
      "text": "该处理的处理掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00034",
      "start_ms": 61230,
      "end_ms": 63865,
      "text": "我整个人心理状态会特别清爽舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00035",
      "start_ms": 64280,
      "end_ms": 65240,
      "text": "你也可以试一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65320,
      "end_ms": 67660,
      "text": "当你内在的秩序无法维持的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67720,
      "end_ms": 69465,
      "text": "可以尝试建立外在的秩序。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00038",
      "start_ms": 69810,
      "end_ms": 72330,
      "text": "通过外部的秩序来回馈到你的内心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00039",
      "start_ms": 72450,
      "end_ms": 75105,
      "text": "让你重拾对生活、对自我的掌控感。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00040",
      "start_ms": 75510,
      "end_ms": 76295,
      "text": "你有没有想过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00041",
      "start_ms": 76510,
      "end_ms": 79210,
      "text": "为什么有些人他的家里永远干净整洁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79270,
      "end_ms": 80565,
      "text": "事业顺风顺水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00043",
      "start_ms": 80880,
      "end_ms": 82420,
      "text": "而有些人明明很努力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00044",
      "start_ms": 82500,
      "end_ms": 85255,
      "text": "却总感觉被一种看不见的力量拖着后腿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00045",
      "start_ms": 85670,
      "end_ms": 86275,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00046",
      "start_ms": 86540,
      "end_ms": 87945,
      "text": "你家里的那些杂物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00047",
      "start_ms": 88220,
      "end_ms": 89785,
      "text": "甚至冰箱里的过期食品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00048",
      "start_ms": 90020,
      "end_ms": 92120,
      "text": "都在悄悄消耗着你的能量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00049",
      "start_ms": 92240,
      "end_ms": 93925,
      "text": "影响着你人生的走向。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00050",
      "start_ms": 94370,
      "end_ms": 96750,
      "text": "如果你想真正掌控生活的秩序感，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00051",
      "start_ms": 96770,
      "end_ms": 97535,
      "text": "一定要记住哦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00052",
      "start_ms": 97940,
      "end_ms": 101220,
      "text": "使用频次越高的东西越该选用好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00053",
      "start_ms": 101360,
      "end_ms": 103340,
      "text": "而每周使用不超过三次的物品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00054",
      "start_ms": 103420,
      "end_ms": 104845,
      "text": "就尽量没必要买回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00055",
      "start_ms": 105200,
      "end_ms": 107545,
      "text": "越复杂的东西故障风险越高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00056",
      "start_ms": 107890,
      "end_ms": 110615,
      "text": "越精致美观的东西便携性越差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00057",
      "start_ms": 110990,
      "end_ms": 112465,
      "text": "集成度越高的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112660,
      "end_ms": 113540,
      "text": "专业性越弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00059",
      "start_ms": 113660,
      "end_ms": 115725,
      "text": "这就是消费领域最为明智的法则。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00060",
      "start_ms": 116180,
      "end_ms": 118680,
      "text": "要明确你的核心需求在关键处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00061",
      "start_ms": 118680,
      "end_ms": 120855,
      "text": "专注在冗余处舍弃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00062",
      "start_ms": 121290,
      "end_ms": 122990,
      "text": "老话说秋后算账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00063",
      "start_ms": 123250,
      "end_ms": 124770,
      "text": "其实人到秋天真的得算。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00064",
      "start_ms": 124770,
      "end_ms": 127160,
      "text": "一、算账消耗你的人要断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00065",
      "start_ms": 127420,
      "end_ms": 128920,
      "text": "第一回报的事儿要清。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00066",
      "start_ms": 128920,
      "end_ms": 130950,
      "text": "一清攒了好久的塑料袋儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00067",
      "start_ms": 130950,
      "end_ms": 132445,
      "text": "多年不穿的旧衣服等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00068",
      "start_ms": 132620,
      "end_ms": 133215,
      "text": "都扔一扔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00069",
      "start_ms": 133520,
      "end_ms": 135840,
      "text": "大胆的先很多人什么东西都攒着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00070",
      "start_ms": 135840,
      "end_ms": 136855,
      "text": "什么都舍不得扔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00071",
      "start_ms": 137180,
      "end_ms": 139680,
      "text": "辣酱瓶子、茶叶、罐子、月饼盒子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00072",
      "start_ms": 139680,
      "end_ms": 140745,
      "text": "各种外卖袋子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00073",
      "start_ms": 140950,
      "end_ms": 141615,
      "text": "什么都存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00074",
      "start_ms": 141830,
      "end_ms": 142575,
      "text": "就是不存钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00075",
      "start_ms": 142850,
      "end_ms": 143710,
      "text": "但是你相信吗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00076",
      "start_ms": 143850,
      "end_ms": 144950,
      "text": "你越扔东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00077",
      "start_ms": 144950,
      "end_ms": 146730,
      "text": "你就活得越好一个东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00078",
      "start_ms": 146730,
      "end_ms": 147790,
      "text": "如果长期不使用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00079",
      "start_ms": 147790,
      "end_ms": 149130,
      "text": "你不和它发生联系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00080",
      "start_ms": 149210,
      "end_ms": 151445,
      "text": "它还会偷偷吸走你的能量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00081",
      "start_ms": 151980,
      "end_ms": 152480,
      "text": "古人说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00082",
      "start_ms": 152620,
      "end_ms": 155580,
      "text": "秋收东藏每一年一到秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00083",
      "start_ms": 155720,
      "end_ms": 157575,
      "text": "你可以扔几件没用的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00084",
      "start_ms": 157850,
      "end_ms": 159485,
      "text": "扔掉讨厌的人就更好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00085",
      "start_ms": 159810,
      "end_ms": 161735,
      "text": "你会莫名其妙的变得幸运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00086",
      "start_ms": 162160,
      "end_ms": 164240,
      "text": "传统文化中秋对应着金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00087",
      "start_ms": 164460,
      "end_ms": 166105,
      "text": "代表着收敛裁决，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00088",
      "start_ms": 166410,
      "end_ms": 167430,
      "text": "所谓秋后算账。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00089",
      "start_ms": 167530,
      "end_ms": 168390,
      "text": "秋天的天时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00090",
      "start_ms": 168390,
      "end_ms": 170460,
      "text": "就是让你舍弃不舍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00091",
      "start_ms": 170520,
      "end_ms": 174025,
      "text": "就不得有舍才有得这就是今生水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00092",
      "start_ms": 174670,
      "end_ms": 176190,
      "text": "你一定要相信大钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00093",
      "start_ms": 176230,
      "end_ms": 178005,
      "text": "喜欢空喜欢安静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00094",
      "start_ms": 178350,
      "end_ms": 179475,
      "text": "越空越有钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00095",
      "start_ms": 179850,
      "end_ms": 181770,
      "text": "收起那些廉价的囤积欲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00096",
      "start_ms": 181890,
      "end_ms": 183005,
      "text": "清空你的环境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00097",
      "start_ms": 183380,
      "end_ms": 184140,
      "text": "空间越满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00098",
      "start_ms": 184220,
      "end_ms": 185020,
      "text": "焦虑越重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00099",
      "start_ms": 185060,
      "end_ms": 185780,
      "text": "欲望越多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00100",
      "start_ms": 185940,
      "end_ms": 186955,
      "text": "判断越乱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00101",
      "start_ms": 187220,
      "end_ms": 189330,
      "text": "而真正的清醒是清空环境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00102",
      "start_ms": 189470,
      "end_ms": 190670,
      "text": "清空无效社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00103",
      "start_ms": 190810,
      "end_ms": 192115,
      "text": "清空廉价信息。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00104",
      "start_ms": 192760,
      "end_ms": 195260,
      "text": "有一种富有叫干净普通人的家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00105",
      "start_ms": 195320,
      "end_ms": 196625,
      "text": "因为干净而富足，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00106",
      "start_ms": 196910,
      "end_ms": 197505,
      "text": "因为干净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00107",
      "start_ms": 197730,
      "end_ms": 200515,
      "text": "所以心情舒畅自然会带来福气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00108",
      "start_ms": 201100,
      "end_ms": 203125,
      "text": "究今夏天已经结束了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00109",
      "start_ms": 203350,
      "end_ms": 203910,
      "text": "一转眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00110",
      "start_ms": 203930,
      "end_ms": 206725,
      "text": "二零二六年也只剩下三分之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00111",
      "start_ms": 207110,
      "end_ms": 209245,
      "text": "把时间献给最值得的人和事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00112",
      "start_ms": 209470,
      "end_ms": 210710,
      "text": "扔掉那些很久不用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00113",
      "start_ms": 210710,
      "end_ms": 212115,
      "text": "以后也不会再用的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00114",
      "start_ms": 212430,
      "end_ms": 214625,
      "text": "扔掉你内心所有的抱怨和杂念，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00115",
      "start_ms": 214860,
      "end_ms": 217015,
      "text": "扔掉所有让你不舒服的关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00116",
      "start_ms": 217280,
      "end_ms": 219505,
      "text": "让自己轻盈轻装上阵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00117",
      "start_ms": 220020,
      "end_ms": 221200,
      "text": "暑去又一秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b9f5e9bc1128d82f_s00118",
      "start_ms": 221480,
      "end_ms": 222745,
      "text": "愿君多珍重。"
    }
  ],
